        Explore GitHub
      </a>
      <a class="button secondary"
         href="https://github.com/Ankryptx/student-grade-analyzer">
        View My Project
      </a>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What I'm building</h2>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>AI and Developer Tools</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          Exploring tools that help developers understand code,
          learn programming and improve their workflow.
          These capabilities are planned, not yet launched.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Student Grade Analyzer</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          A Python project using scikit-learn to explore
          student grade analysis.
        </p>
        <a href="https://github.com/Ankryptx/student-grade-analyzer">
          Explore repository →
        </a>
