    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>About ANKRYPT</h2>
      <p class="muted">
        ANKRYPT is currently at the idea and development stage.
        I'm building my portfolio, learning new technologies
        and working toward practical projects.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="muted">
    © 2026 ANKRYPT · Built with GitHub Pages
  </footer>
